            "role": "assistant",
            "content": [
              {
                "type": "output_text",
                "text": "Arrr, me hearty! 'Tis a sunny 'n warm day out there, so ye best dress light 'n ready fer adventure! Here be me trusty suggestions:  \n\n- **Top:** A breezy cotton shirt or tank top, aye—somethin' that'll keep the sun's bite off yer back but let the fresh air flow.  \n- **Bottoms:** Grab ye a pair o' shorts or a light, airy skirt—movin' easy'll be key today, matey.  \n- **Footwear:** Sandals or comfy deck shoes be perfect fer strollin' about, no boots needed on such a fair-weather voyage!  \n- **Extras:** Toss on a hat 'n some sunnies to shield yer eyes n' noggin from that bright ol' sun, and don't forget yer sunscreen—ye wouldn’t want to roast like a lobster!  \n\nNow get out there 'n enjoy the day, me fine friend! The weather’s callin’ ye to set sail fer good times! \uD83C\uDF1E",
